DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash on NVIDIA GB10 nodes: branch deepseek-v41-zig-tp4 of this fork
Copyright 2026 BertholomusAI (Albert Lee, https://github.com/bertholomus)

This branch adds a DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash family to TensorFold's native engine, under the same Apache License,
Version 2.0 (LICENSE), and runs it on two or four GB10 nodes. Its new files are under zig/src/families/dsv41/,
zig/kernels/cuda/dsv41/ (with zig/kernels/cuda/dsv41_ops.cu and dsv41_torch.cu) and tools/dsv41-zig/, plus
zig/src/server/effort_values_test.zig, zig/src/server/reply_parity.zig, ATTRIBUTION.md and three license texts in
LICENSES/ (PyTorch, CUTLASS, Pillow) that THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md refers to. ATTRIBUTION.md lists every outside source
the family uses and what it took from each. The branch changes these upstream files:
